{
  "env": {
    "RELAY_MIN_LINES": "500",
    "RELAY_SCOUT_MODEL": "sonnet",
    "RELAY_BULK_MODEL": "haiku"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "claude-fable-5-1[1m]",
  "hooks": {
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/dev/vala/hairness/hooks/cc-status.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/claude-inhibit.sh idle"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PermissionRequest": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/dev/vala/hairness/hooks/cc-status.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/pr-create-ticket-progression.sh",
            "if": "Bash(gh pr create*)",
            "statusMessage": "Linking PR to ticket"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/block-fs-scans.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/dev/vala/hairness/hooks/cc-status.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/prompt-relay/read-scope-guard.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/prompt-relay/bash-read-guard.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent|Task",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/prompt-relay/scout-model-pin.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/claude-inhibit.sh idle"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "park hook run",
            "timeout": 10,
            "statusMessage": "Checking parked work..."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/dev/vala/hairness/hooks/cc-status.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/claude-inhibit.sh idle"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/skills/ticket-progression/stop-nudge",
            "statusMessage": "Checking ticket link"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "sh $HOME/.claude/hooks/turn-marker.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/dev/vala/hairness/hooks/cc-status.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.local/bin/moshi-hook claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "$HOME/.claude/hooks/claude-inhibit.sh busy"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "python3 ~/.claude/statusline.py",
    "padding": 0
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "ponytail@ponytail": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "calibrate": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "akshat4165/calibrate"
      },
      "autoUpdate": true
    },
    "claude-code-plugins": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "anthropics/claude-code"
      }
    },
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      },
      "autoUpdate": true
    }
  },
  "outputStyle": "Explanatory",
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-fable-5-1": {
      "effortLevel": "low"
    }
  },
  "autoCompactWindow": 750000,
  "tui": "default",
  "theme": "dark",
  "editorMode": "normal",
  "autoCompactEnabled": true,
  "remoteControlAtStartup": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(ansible-playbook:* --check)"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: private (svandragt/infra-puffin, via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured \u2014 treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch main; no rulesets or protected-branch rules listed (svandragt/infra-puffin, via gh)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo (svandragt/infra-puffin on github.com) and its remote(s) only (no additional orgs configured)",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: vandragt.com and its subdomains (micro.vandragt.com, yt.vandragt.com, fileshare.vandragt.com, 2020.vandragt.com, albatross.vandragt.com, 2022.vandragt.com, puffin.vandragt.com), and amasan.co.uk \u2014 seen repeatedly in this project's transcript-mined host contacts",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: puffin.vandragt.com (this repo's provisioning target, per README); rulesnapper app (co-hosted on puffin, per README)",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material; preserve exact handles when known and share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment (hyphen/underscore/dot-delimited \u2014 e.g. matches `prod-db`, not `producer`)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured \u2014 fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries `prod` or `production` as a whole word or name segment; this repo's Ansible roles provisioning puffin (base hardening, ufw, fail2ban, SSH) treated as protected infra",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development \u2014 infrastructure provisioning via Ansible for this repo (puffin)",
      "**Trusted repo**: The git repository at $HOME/dev/_infra/puffin (working directory) and its remote github.com:svandragt/infra-puffin.git \u2014 private, so confidential material is fine to commit/push here, but content ported from outside this session's repo is not this repo's own work",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: None configured"
    ]
  }
}
